{"4733960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Heim", "steam_appid": 4733960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733960/extras/dc79488e40d9a67b7b07d20a2a5b5646.webp?t=1786697507\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733960/extras/dc79488e40d9a67b7b07d20a2a5b5646.poster.avif?t=1786697507\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=62 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733960/extras/252e42586262e34a4fa36f50620f67a6.poster.avif?t=1786697507\" width=616 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733960/extras/252e42586262e34a4fa36f50620f67a6.webm?t=1786697507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733960/extras/252e42586262e34a4fa36f50620f67a6.mp4?t=1786697507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The troll cave opens and the clock starts ticking. You and your friends have been sent by Mama Troll to retrieve three sacred relics. They’re lost somewhere deep in an ancient forest, and you only have a few nights to bring them back before the cave collapses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733960/extras/0d52a13e855b7fbf5afce4dc4aa98cf7.webp?t=1786697507\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733960/extras/0d52a13e855b7fbf5afce4dc4aa98cf7.poster.avif?t=1786697507\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=62 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733960/extras/d17125b954e67df6e020d1c9f20d845b.poster.avif?t=1786697507\" width=616 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733960/extras/d17125b954e67df6e020d1c9f20d845b.webm?t=1786697507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733960/extras/d17125b954e67df6e020d1c9f20d845b.mp4?t=1786697507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the sun rises, you petrify. Step into a beam of sunlight and your body turns to stone instantly. Stick to the shadows, plan your routes, and move carefully through the forest. Or risk becoming part of the landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733960/extras/6f76944ab95a73f62be854e3b9bb82a9.webp?t=1786697507\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733960/extras/6f76944ab95a73f62be854e3b9bb82a9.poster.avif?t=1786697507\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=62 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733960/extras/104399eed26b2e03c247f8633b13cb68.poster.avif?t=1786697507\" width=616 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733960/extras/104399eed26b2e03c247f8633b13cb68.webm?t=1786697507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733960/extras/104399eed26b2e03c247f8633b13cb68.mp4?t=1786697507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have three days to retrieve the relics. Explore during the night, hide and survive during the day, and find all items before it’s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic co-op play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadly sunlight mechanics — hide or turn to stone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traps, hazards, and unpredictable situations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team-based treasure carrying and coordination</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique Claymation look</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733960/extras/dc79488e40d9a67b7b07d20a2a5b5646.webp?t=1786697507\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733960/extras/dc79488e40d9a67b7b07d20a2a5b5646.poster.avif?t=1786697507\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=62 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733960/extras/252e42586262e34a4fa36f50620f67a6.poster.avif?t=1786697507\" width=616 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733960/extras/252e42586262e34a4fa36f50620f67a6.webm?t=1786697507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733960/extras/252e42586262e34a4fa36f50620f67a6.mp4?t=1786697507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The troll cave opens and the clock starts ticking. You and your friends have been sent by Mama Troll to retrieve three sacred relics. They’re lost somewhere deep in an ancient forest, and you only have a few nights to bring them back before the cave collapses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733960/extras/0d52a13e855b7fbf5afce4dc4aa98cf7.webp?t=1786697507\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733960/extras/0d52a13e855b7fbf5afce4dc4aa98cf7.poster.avif?t=1786697507\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=62 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733960/extras/d17125b954e67df6e020d1c9f20d845b.poster.avif?t=1786697507\" width=616 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733960/extras/d17125b954e67df6e020d1c9f20d845b.webm?t=1786697507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733960/extras/d17125b954e67df6e020d1c9f20d845b.mp4?t=1786697507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the sun rises, you petrify. Step into a beam of sunlight and your body turns to stone instantly. Stick to the shadows, plan your routes, and move carefully through the forest. Or risk becoming part of the landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733960/extras/6f76944ab95a73f62be854e3b9bb82a9.webp?t=1786697507\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733960/extras/6f76944ab95a73f62be854e3b9bb82a9.poster.avif?t=1786697507\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=62 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733960/extras/104399eed26b2e03c247f8633b13cb68.poster.avif?t=1786697507\" width=616 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733960/extras/104399eed26b2e03c247f8633b13cb68.webm?t=1786697507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733960/extras/104399eed26b2e03c247f8633b13cb68.mp4?t=1786697507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have three days to retrieve the relics. Explore during the night, hide and survive during the day, and find all items before it’s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic co-op play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadly sunlight mechanics — hide or turn to stone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traps, hazards, and unpredictable situations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team-based treasure carrying and coordination</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique Claymation look</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "HEIM is a multiplayer party game for 2-6 players where you play as trolls and while avoiding sun rays, retrieve artifacts scattered in the forest to bring them back to your cave.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Norwegian<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4733960/e4fc2b0df9baf2dda1fd621cdf5c809e73e7837c/header.jpg?t=1786697507", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam